  "rulings": [
    {
      "text": "Requirements do not apply when taking control of a card already in play. [TOM 19960226-1]",
      "group": "",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[TOM 19960226-1]",
          "label": "TOM 19960226-1",
          "url": "https://usenet.krcg.org/t/16y-ZD7Xats/#m1"
        }
      ],
      "cards": [],
      "symbols": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If used to steal an equipment representing a location, it can be placed on any minion controlled by the new controller. [RTR 19960112]",
      "group": "",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[RTR 19960112]",
          "label": "RTR 19960112",
          "url": "https://usenet.krcg.org/t/d3n3StNS7no/#m0"
        }
      ],
      "cards": [],
      "symbols": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If used to \"change\" the control of a location or equipment representing a location to the same Methuselah, the location cannot be moved to another minion controlled by the same Methuselah. [LSJ 19971002]",
      "group": "",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[LSJ 19971002]",
          "label": "LSJ 19971002",
          "url": "https://usenet.krcg.org/t/RY_nhdykKP0/#m1"
        }
      ],
      "cards": [],
      "symbols": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Changing the controller of a location has no other effect, unless specified by card text. Exception: A location \"on\" another controlled card is moved onto an appropriate card controlled by the new controller of the location. [RTR 19980623]",
      "group": "Changes controller of location",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[RTR 19980623]",
          "label": "RTR 19980623",
          "url": "https://usenet.krcg.org/t/tSpd9dtTElc/#m0"
        }
      ],
      "cards": [],
      "symbols": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cannot be used or played if the conditions for the terms of the referendum cannot be met (e.g. no legal selection, insufficient cards/players to choose from, prohibited by card text, uniqueness, etc). [LSJ 20100129] [ANK 20191228]",
      "group": "Political action with illegal terms",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[LSJ 20100129]",
          "label": "LSJ 20100129",
          "url": "https://usenet.krcg.org/t/X8Uu7Sk56P4/#m8"
        },
        {
          "text": "[ANK 20191228]",
          "label": "ANK 20191228",
          "url": "https://www.vekn.net/forum/rules-questions/78262-parity-shift-without-target#98358"
        }
      ],
